### Bienvenida
GET http://localhost:8080/

### Obtener todos los servicios
GET http://localhost:8080/api/services

### Crear un servicio
POST http://localhost:8080/api/services
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Masaje relajante",
  "duration": 60,
  "price": 18000,
  "category": "bienestar",
  "available": true
}

### Crear un servicio incompleto — debe responder 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/services
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Servicio incompleto"
}

### Copiar aquí un UUID real obtenido mediante GET
@serviceId = cbd26ef5-4f83-4bd9-9a58-493f7fca1c06

### Obtener un servicio por UUID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/services/{{serviceId}}

### Actualizar solamente el precio
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/services/{{serviceId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 13500
}

### Intentar cambiar el ID — debe conservar el original
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/services/{{serviceId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "ID-ENVIADO-POR-EL-CLIENTE",
  "available": false
}

### Eliminar el servicio
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/services/{{serviceId}}
